%% Sequence 08a — Create project and seed role templates
%% Updated: 2026-07-27.
%% Scenario: organization owner/admin creates one project and optionally seeds professional roles.
%% Evidence status: Implemented. Initial staffing continuation is Sequence 08a1.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Organization owner / admin
    participant C as «boundary» CreateProjectWithStaffingController
    participant K as «control» CreateProjectCommand
    participant D as «entity» PostgreSQL
    participant A as «control» ProjectAuditEventPublisher
    participant E as «control» ProjectEventPublisher
    participant S as «control» SkillPublicApi

    U->>C: POST project and optional role templates
    activate C
    C->>K: handle(CreateProjectDTO)
    activate K
    K->>D: Check permission/membership, create project and owner row
    activate D
    D-->>K: Project persisted
    deactivate D
    K->>A: publishProjectAudit(create)
    activate A
    A-->>K: Audit recorded
    deactivate A
    K->>D: Commit project transaction
    activate D
    D-->>K: Committed project and owner membership
    deactivate D
    K->>E: publishProjectCreated(event)
    activate E
    E-->>K: Event published
    deactivate E
    K-->>C: Project detail
    deactivate K
    opt Role templates requested
        loop Each unique template code
            C->>S: Find active template and clone to project
            activate S
            S-->>C: Project professional role or skip
            deactivate S
        end
    end
    Note over C,S: Initial member assignment continues in Sequence 08a1
    C-->>U: Project detail and selected focus
    deactivate C
